  "details": "The cursor can interfere with gameplay in certain situations, such as when watching videos in the media player, when the personal mirror is enabled in immersive mode, and potentially in other scenarios.\n\nSince the system cursor can be enabled via Tab, the in-game cursor may also occasionally appear and interfere in these cases.\n\nI propose adding a toggle for the in-game cursor in the settings, and also disabling it via Ctrl+H, as it is part of the UI.",
